{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2022-06-28 08:06:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE TEAMS UP WITH U.S. SOCCER STARS ROSE LAVELLE AND SOPHIA SMITH TO LAUNCH NEW MENU ITEMS AHEAD OF QUALIFYING GAMES', 'text': "GUESTS CAN EAT LIKE THESE USA ATHLETES AND HELP RAISE FUNDS FOR THE FAMILIES OF AMERICA'S SERVICE MEMBERS NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF. , JUNE 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS PARTNERING WITH U.S. WOMEN'S NATIONAL TEAM (USWNT) SOCCER PLAYERS ROSE LAVELLE AND SOPHIA SMITH TO LAUNCH THEIR GO-TO ORDERS AS OFFICIAL MENU ITEMS ON THE CHIPOTLE APP AND CHIPOTLE.COM FOR A LIMITED TIME STARTING JULY 1."}